---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../site.config';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About this technology blog." locale="en" section="about">
  <section class="en-page-head"><h1>About.</h1><p>A place to write down technical problems, experiments, and solutions.</p></section>
  <div class="reading-width"><div class="en-about-panel"><h2>Hi, I'm {site.author}.</h2><p>I use this blog to document technical questions I encounter while learning and building projects. I write when a problem is worth understanding, and I hope the result helps someone facing the same thing.</p><p>Most posts cover AI agents, developer tools, and engineering practice. I try to explain the reasoning, the code, and the mistakes along the way.</p></div><section class="about-section"><h2>Education</h2><div class="en-education"><img src={site.education.emblem} alt="South China Normal University emblem" width="66" height="72" loading="lazy" /><div><span>Undergraduate · 2024–2028</span><h3><a href={site.education.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">South China Normal University ↗</a></h3></div></div></section><section class="about-section"><h2>Keep reading</h2><p>Want to see what I write about? Start with the latest articles.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/blog/">Browse articles ↗</a></section></div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.about-section{margin-top:55px}.about-section h2{font-size:1.5rem}.about-section p{color:var(--muted)}</style>
